# Hashed sanitized fixtures must round-trip byte-for-byte across
# platforms so their tracked SHA-256 sidecars verify from a clean
# `git archive` or fresh checkout. Marking them binary disables all
# line-ending conversion (checkout, commit, and archive).
tests/fixtures/bithumb/sanitized/**/*.json -text
tests/fixtures/bithumb/sanitized/**/*.sha256 -text
